        <headline>Flood Warning issued September 25 at 9:51AM MDT until September 25 at 10:00AM MDT by NWS Albuquerque NM</headline>
        <description>The Flood Warning will expire at 10 AM MDT this morning for a portion
of central New Mexico, including the following area, Lincoln.

Flood waters have receded. Flooding is no longer expected to pose a
threat.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 1200 AM MDT Saturday for
portions of central, east central, and southeast New Mexico...
</description>
